<title>USA: Airtouch Q3 shr $0.10 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Airtouch Q3 shr $0.10 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  Q3	  1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.10		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			 52,200		   46,700</p>
<p> Revs		     600,700		  414,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 500,191		  495,094</p>
<p>					 9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.33		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			165,600		  120,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,530,900		1,192,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 499,450		  494,590</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Airtouch Communications Inc.</p>
<p>Q3 and 9 mos 1996 reflect the consolidation of 100 pct of the operating results for cellular operations in Michigan and Ohio from Aug. 16, 1996 through Sept. 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Revenue figures for 1995 have been restated to classify roaming fraud as an operating expense as it was in 1996.</p>
